300% more access. One shared mission. A lot to celebrate. 🎉✂️

The new Middle Tyger Education Center is officially open! This $19 million campus will expand access to early care and education by more than 300%, while creating a place for children and families to learn, grow, and thrive.

We loved celebrating this milestone with @middletyger and the incredible team that brought it to life.

